दैवो विस्तरश: प्रोक्त आसुरं पार्थ मे श‍ृणु ॥ ६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4162,\"bb\":3661,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/16/6/b3661/\",\"body_value\":\"dvau bhūta-sargau loke ’smin
daiva āsura eva ca
